  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">EL EFECTO DEL CAPITAL SOCIAL EN EL BIENESTAR FAMILIAR EN EL VRAEM, PER&#xda;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE EFFECT OF SOCIAL CAPITAL ON FAMILY WELLBEING IN VRAEM, PERU</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">el acuerdo de cooperaci&#xf3;n de tres a&#xf1;os examinar&#xe1; el impacto del programa mlcm y la metodolog&#xed;a hc en una zona de conflicto plagada de narcotr&#xe1;fico conocida como el valle de los r&#xed;os apurmac, ene y mantaro (vraem).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">the three-year cooperative agreement will examine the impact of the mlcm program and hc methodology in a conflict zone fraught with drug traffic known as the apurmac, ene, and mantaro river valley (vraem by its acronym in spanish).</narrative>
  </description>
